WEBVTT

00:00:06.770 --> 00:00:08.770
<b>Meiji Tokyo Renka</b>

00:01:32.370 --> 00:01:33.730
E-Excuse me!

00:01:34.370 --> 00:01:35.740
Where are we going?

00:01:35.740 --> 00:01:37.340
Just be quiet and come with me.

00:01:37.340 --> 00:01:38.900
You want to become a woman, right?

00:01:38.900 --> 00:01:39.990
I-I do!

00:01:39.990 --> 00:01:41.910
My hair is going to be a mess.

00:01:41.910 --> 00:01:43.050
My hair is a mess.

00:01:43.050 --> 00:01:45.160
A mess, a mess, my hair is a mess!

00:01:44.750 --> 00:01:46.250
<b>Geisha
House</b>

00:01:45.160 --> 00:01:46.260
Okay, we're here.

00:01:46.500 --> 00:01:49.150
I'm back. I will be in my room.

00:01:49.150 --> 00:01:50.960
Sure. You have a guest?

00:01:50.960 --> 00:01:52.500
Something like that.

00:01:54.620 --> 00:01:57.170
Now, my room is up there. Go on ahead.

00:01:57.490 --> 00:02:00.380
O-Okay. Pardon my intrusion.

00:02:02.770 --> 00:02:05.000
Stop dawdling already, come on.

00:02:05.000 --> 00:02:06.840
This is my room.

00:02:06.840 --> 00:02:09.440
Welcome to the best geisha 
house in Kagurazaka.

00:02:09.440 --> 00:02:10.270
Huh?

00:02:10.270 --> 00:02:12.020
Geisha house?

00:02:10.520 --> 00:02:12.020
<b>Geisha House</b>

00:02:12.020 --> 00:02:14.240
What kind of house is that?

00:02:14.860 --> 00:02:17.230
What? You've never heard of a geisha house?

00:02:17.230 --> 00:02:21.040
No, I only recently came to this 
time period... I mean, to Tokyo.

00:02:21.040 --> 00:02:24.040
I see. So that's why...

00:02:24.040 --> 00:02:26.060
Why, what?

00:02:28.780 --> 00:02:32.430
This is a boarding house for girls who 
have gathered from all over Japan to study

00:02:32.430 --> 00:02:37.550
tea ceremonies, flower arranging, 
shamisen, taiko, singing, and dancing.

00:02:37.550 --> 00:02:39.550
And you learned how to do
those things as well?

00:02:40.370 --> 00:02:41.810
That is correct.

00:02:41.810 --> 00:02:44.440
So if I practice those things here too,

00:02:44.440 --> 00:02:46.550
will I be able to become like a 
lady from a noble family?

00:02:46.550 --> 00:02:48.550
Of course!

00:02:48.550 --> 00:02:52.030
Because women and ghosts 
can turn into anything.

00:02:52.030 --> 00:02:53.500
G-Ghosts?

00:02:53.800 --> 00:02:55.570
As long as you have the determination,

00:02:55.570 --> 00:03:00.320
even you can become the daughter of a 
noble family or the best geisha in Japan.

00:03:00.320 --> 00:03:02.820
I could? You mean it?

00:03:02.820 --> 00:03:04.840
Yes. How about it?

00:03:04.840 --> 00:03:06.810
Would you like me to train you?

00:03:06.810 --> 00:03:11.560
Yes! Please make me into a 
fully-fledged ideal Japanese woman!

00:03:11.560 --> 00:03:14.000
This is going to be a long road...

00:03:21.510 --> 00:03:24.350
<b>The Long Road to Becoming a Fiancée</b>

00:03:24.770 --> 00:03:26.850
First of all, you have no sex appeal.

00:03:26.850 --> 00:03:27.700
Yes, ma'am.

00:03:27.700 --> 00:03:30.030
And your demeanor is unrefined.

00:03:30.030 --> 00:03:30.600
Yes, ma'am.

00:03:30.600 --> 00:03:32.560
You're not even wearing your kimono properly.

00:03:32.560 --> 00:03:33.210
Yes, ma'am.

00:03:33.210 --> 00:03:34.780
How you remove your shoes

00:03:34.780 --> 00:03:37.160
and how you climb the 
stairs are unacceptable.

00:03:37.160 --> 00:03:40.150
And you're utterly terrible 
at opening sliding doors.

00:03:41.150 --> 00:03:42.610
I-I'm that bad?

00:03:42.610 --> 00:03:47.070
A young lady from a noble family learns the art of 
serving tea and arranging flowers from a young age

00:03:47.070 --> 00:03:50.000
and naturally acquires the 
knowledge of proper etiquette.

00:03:50.000 --> 00:03:53.680
Trying to make you into a lady overnight 
is going to be a challenge.

00:03:54.640 --> 00:03:58.390
Still, I want to become a more 
refined person, no matter what!

00:03:58.390 --> 00:04:01.860
I want to be a beautiful and wonderful 
woman like you, Otoyakko-san.

00:04:02.350 --> 00:04:04.540
You do know how to flatter me.

00:04:04.540 --> 00:04:06.380
I certainly can't say no to that.

00:04:07.140 --> 00:04:12.520
I, your mentor, will begin drumming what it 
means to be ladylike into you without delay.

00:04:12.520 --> 00:04:13.770
Yes, ma'am!

00:04:13.770 --> 00:04:15.350
Thank you for taking care of me.

00:04:15.350 --> 00:04:17.590
Of course. Now then, take off your clothes.

00:04:17.590 --> 00:04:18.060
Huh?

00:04:18.060 --> 00:04:20.110
Don't just sit there looking dumb,
 take it off lickety-split!

00:04:20.110 --> 00:04:21.020
Lickety-split?

00:04:21.020 --> 00:04:21.940
Quickly, now!

00:04:21.940 --> 00:04:22.860
Y-Yes, ma'am!

00:04:26.290 --> 00:04:28.060
Don't take off that part!

00:04:28.060 --> 00:04:29.040
Eh?

00:04:29.040 --> 00:04:30.870
G-Goodness, forgive me.

00:04:30.870 --> 00:04:33.670
I have a bad habit of scolding 
newcomers. It just slipped out.

00:04:33.670 --> 00:04:36.270
A woman from Hakata shouldn't 
speak so rudely.

00:04:38.770 --> 00:04:41.810
Now then, before you put on your 
kimono you need to sit here.

00:04:42.220 --> 00:04:45.110
Let's start by focusing on 
your looks for a moment.

00:04:45.110 --> 00:04:46.420
My looks?

00:04:46.430 --> 00:04:48.390
Before practice or going out, 
a woman prepares herself

00:04:48.390 --> 00:04:51.520
by sitting before a mirror, like this, 
 looking at herself and chanting,

00:04:51.540 --> 00:04:55.830
"Make me beautiful, make me beautiful," 
as if casting a spell.

00:04:55.830 --> 00:04:58.070
Oh, that makes sense.

00:04:58.550 --> 00:05:01.840
Make me beautiful, make me beautiful,

00:05:01.840 --> 00:05:04.310
make me beautiful.

00:05:05.340 --> 00:05:07.580
You're really putting your spirit into it.

00:05:07.910 --> 00:05:12.310
May I ask the reason why you 
are so focused on all of this?

00:05:12.310 --> 00:05:13.090
Of course.

00:05:13.350 --> 00:05:16.590
There's someone who has 
been looking after me,

00:05:16.590 --> 00:05:20.090
and I need to make myself beautiful for him.

00:05:21.580 --> 00:05:25.190
He has been very kind to me,

00:05:25.190 --> 00:05:30.080
and I don't want others to think 
it's strange if I'm by his side.

00:05:31.340 --> 00:05:32.680
You're in love.

00:05:32.680 --> 00:05:33.340
Eh?

00:05:33.340 --> 00:05:34.850
Don't move, now.

00:05:34.850 --> 00:05:35.610
Sorry...

00:05:35.610 --> 00:05:36.550
Perfect.

00:05:36.960 --> 00:05:39.240
I don't mind women like you.

00:05:39.240 --> 00:05:42.850
But I don't know what I'm supposed to do...

00:05:43.610 --> 00:05:45.210
Turn and look at me.

00:05:46.360 --> 00:05:51.300
Ghosts transform with spiritual power, 
while women transform with make-up.

00:06:03.620 --> 00:06:04.690
Hello?

00:06:06.580 --> 00:06:08.740
This will be the real test.

00:06:10.330 --> 00:06:12.520
Try putting this kimono on yourself.

00:06:12.520 --> 00:06:13.900
Okay.

00:06:14.270 --> 00:06:15.530
Let's see...

00:06:15.930 --> 00:06:18.720
This cord ties here like this...

00:06:19.690 --> 00:06:21.260
This is rather hopeless.

00:06:21.570 --> 00:06:22.520
All done!

00:06:22.520 --> 00:06:23.270
Zero points!

00:06:23.270 --> 00:06:24.270
Wha?!

00:06:24.270 --> 00:06:25.210
Pay attention.

00:06:25.210 --> 00:06:26.980
First, your under collar is showing too much.

00:06:26.980 --> 00:06:28.930
It's open too wide and
needs to be more modest.

00:06:28.930 --> 00:06:29.780
Under collar?

00:06:29.780 --> 00:06:31.840
The area here where you collars overlap.

00:06:32.530 --> 00:06:34.780
And don't pull your inner collar so tightly.

00:06:34.780 --> 00:06:37.710
It's stylish to pull it back 
about the width of a fist.

00:06:37.710 --> 00:06:40.030
This way you wear comfortably wear it open.

00:06:40.030 --> 00:06:41.710
Inner collar?

00:06:41.710 --> 00:06:43.840
"Inner" refers to the back collar area here.

00:06:43.840 --> 00:06:45.550
You don't even know that?

00:06:45.550 --> 00:06:46.960
You're right.

00:06:46.960 --> 00:06:49.800
Your collar is open 
really wide, Otoyakko-san!

00:06:49.800 --> 00:06:52.310
That's because I'm emphasizing my allure.

00:06:52.310 --> 00:06:55.570
It's not wise for you to imitate me, 
since you're trying to become a lady.

00:06:55.570 --> 00:06:58.660
You'll be seen as vulgar 
if you're not careful.

00:06:58.660 --> 00:07:01.560
So that's what it would mean? 
This is so hard.

00:07:01.830 --> 00:07:06.800
Gentlemen can tell a woman's upbringing 
from one look at how she wears her kimono,

00:07:06.800 --> 00:07:08.560
so you must take care.

00:07:08.560 --> 00:07:09.930
I will keep that in mind.

00:07:10.810 --> 00:07:12.300
Now then, your hem.

00:07:12.300 --> 00:07:15.380
You have it pulled up so 
high you look like a child.

00:07:15.380 --> 00:07:18.320
Oh, okay. I thought I would 
trip if it was too long.

00:07:18.320 --> 00:07:21.090
That's because you haven't 
learned how to move properly.

00:07:21.090 --> 00:07:23.850
The hem needs to be just a 
bit longer than you think,

00:07:23.850 --> 00:07:27.590
and having just the slightest hint 
of the ankles showing is best.

00:07:28.580 --> 00:07:31.080
It seems like everything impresses you,

00:07:31.670 --> 00:07:35.090
but why hasn't your sweetheart 
said anything about any of this?

00:07:35.090 --> 00:07:39.090
Well, I get the sense that he's not 
really concerned about such things.

00:07:40.510 --> 00:07:45.100
I would think if a man wanted his woman to 
be beautiful, he'd say a thing or two about it.

00:07:45.100 --> 00:07:48.610
N-No, I'm not his woman 
or anything like that.

00:07:48.610 --> 00:07:51.160
Nevermind that. Try walking around a bit.

00:07:51.160 --> 00:07:53.350
Eh? Uh... huh? Walk around?

00:07:53.350 --> 00:07:54.730
Like this?

00:07:54.730 --> 00:07:56.380
Hey! Think about what you're doing!

00:07:56.380 --> 00:08:00.040
Your kimono will come apart if you walk like that!

00:08:02.620 --> 00:08:05.380
This will require slightly 
more drastic measures.

00:08:05.380 --> 00:08:07.300
We're going to drill this relentlessly.

00:08:07.300 --> 00:08:08.390
Yes, ma'am!

00:08:08.390 --> 00:08:10.670
Straighten your neck and back!

00:08:10.670 --> 00:08:13.910
Relax your shoulders a bit 
and draw them back slightly.

00:08:14.540 --> 00:08:15.600
Too much!

00:08:16.340 --> 00:08:18.220
Don't point your toes out.

00:08:18.880 --> 00:08:21.630
Shorten your stride so you don't 
mess up your hem when you walk.

00:08:22.180 --> 00:08:24.230
Don't walk like a baby chick, either!

00:08:25.120 --> 00:08:29.970
When sitting, slide your hand under 
your knee so the hem folds neatly.

00:08:30.810 --> 00:08:32.020
Try again!

00:08:32.020 --> 00:08:32.950
Yes, ma'am!

00:08:32.950 --> 00:08:35.400
What are you, a roly-poly toy?

00:08:35.710 --> 00:08:38.160
When you go to reach for something, 
gently hold onto your sleeve.

00:08:38.160 --> 00:08:39.860
Got it.

00:08:40.170 --> 00:08:42.700
You shouldn't be able to see your arm!

00:08:43.410 --> 00:08:43.890
Back!

00:08:43.890 --> 00:08:44.420
Shoulders!

00:08:44.420 --> 00:08:44.890
Hem!

00:08:44.890 --> 00:08:45.410
Sleeve!

00:08:45.410 --> 00:08:45.900
Neck!

00:08:45.900 --> 00:08:46.430
Arms!

00:08:46.430 --> 00:08:46.910
Voice!

00:08:46.910 --> 00:08:47.410
Face!

00:08:47.410 --> 00:08:49.210
Huh? Face?

00:08:49.930 --> 00:08:51.170
In all things...

00:08:51.170 --> 00:08:54.190
Do not hesitate! Do not be fazed!
 Be dignified! Graceful! And refined!

00:08:54.190 --> 00:08:56.430
So strict!

00:08:56.430 --> 00:08:57.920
We're not done!

00:09:01.080 --> 00:09:04.430
I had no idea becoming a 
lady would be this hard.

00:09:04.430 --> 00:09:07.140
Beauty isn't won in a day.

00:09:07.140 --> 00:09:08.440
Otoyakko.

00:09:09.270 --> 00:09:11.260
It is time for supper.

00:09:11.260 --> 00:09:13.830
You should have something to eat 
before going to the dinner party.

00:09:13.830 --> 00:09:15.790
Perfect timing, Mother.

00:09:15.790 --> 00:09:18.940
Please give her one of the 
grilled fish from earlier.

00:09:18.940 --> 00:09:20.440
Yes, of course.

00:09:21.160 --> 00:09:23.450
You don't have to feed me dinner!

00:09:26.250 --> 00:09:27.210
It's no trouble at all.

00:09:27.540 --> 00:09:30.970
Besides, I'm not exactly 
treating you to dinner.

00:09:30.970 --> 00:09:31.840
Huh?

00:09:33.070 --> 00:09:35.870
Now, go on and eat.

00:09:35.870 --> 00:09:37.250
Are you sure?

00:09:37.760 --> 00:09:38.980
Thank you for the food!

00:09:39.970 --> 00:09:41.210
You idiot!

00:09:42.230 --> 00:09:44.970
Don't stab your chopsticks in so deep!

00:09:45.220 --> 00:09:47.380
When children from good families eat,

00:09:47.380 --> 00:09:49.990
only three-fifths of the chopstick 
tip will be sullied.

00:09:49.990 --> 00:09:51.530
That's all?

00:09:51.530 --> 00:09:52.220
That's all.

00:09:52.750 --> 00:09:56.000
They also eat elegantly and beautifully
 without making a sound.

00:09:56.000 --> 00:09:57.980
Now, please eat.

00:09:59.420 --> 00:10:01.930
T-Thank you for the food.

00:10:07.240 --> 00:10:09.500
It's delicious!

00:10:09.500 --> 00:10:11.750
Training is delicious!

00:10:11.750 --> 00:10:15.000
Your training to become 
a lady has only just begun.

00:10:15.000 --> 00:10:19.010
Come here again tomorrow, 
and I will train you intensely.

00:10:19.300 --> 00:10:20.750
Thank you so much!

00:10:20.750 --> 00:10:22.880
Oh, but in exchange,

00:10:22.880 --> 00:10:26.800
do not tell anyone about me 
or about coming here.

00:10:26.800 --> 00:10:27.790
Promise me.

00:10:27.790 --> 00:10:29.720
Okay, I promise!

00:10:43.320 --> 00:10:46.670
You have good taste, Mori-san.

00:10:53.060 --> 00:10:55.080
I completely lost track of time.

00:10:56.320 --> 00:10:57.810
I have returned...

00:10:58.730 --> 00:11:00.550
Well, welcome back.

00:11:05.710 --> 00:11:07.460
I apologize for being out so late.

00:11:14.560 --> 00:11:15.380
Mei.

00:11:18.050 --> 00:11:20.220
O-Ougai-san?

00:11:22.490 --> 00:11:24.940
Looks like you had a rather enjoyable outing.

00:11:24.940 --> 00:11:26.400
Where have you been off to?

00:11:26.400 --> 00:11:27.940
Oh, to Otoya—

00:11:28.520 --> 00:11:30.240
N-Nowhere in particular.

00:11:30.240 --> 00:11:34.740
I just went for a walk and before 
I knew it I lost track of time.

00:11:38.630 --> 00:11:40.010
Is that so?

00:11:40.010 --> 00:11:43.550
It is dangerous to be out at night, 
so please try to be careful next time.

00:11:43.550 --> 00:11:44.420
I will.

00:11:44.820 --> 00:11:48.530
I-I'm going to go see if Fumi-san needs help.

00:11:50.170 --> 00:11:51.570
That was too close.

00:11:51.570 --> 00:11:54.070
<i>I made that promise to Otoyakko-san.</i>

00:11:54.420 --> 00:11:55.530
Watch where you're—!

00:11:59.880 --> 00:12:02.140
I-I'm so sorry, Syunso-san!

00:12:03.030 --> 00:12:05.930
I wondered where you'd gotten off to.

00:12:05.930 --> 00:12:08.160
Were you precociously sneaking 
a peek at the amusement quarters?

00:12:08.410 --> 00:12:10.150
T-The amusement quarters?!

00:12:10.150 --> 00:12:14.710
This is the first time you've 
worn rouge on your lips.

00:12:15.410 --> 00:12:16.720
Shoot!

00:12:16.720 --> 00:12:18.430
Why bother now?

00:12:18.430 --> 00:12:21.680
D-Do you think Ougai-san noticed it too?

00:12:21.680 --> 00:12:24.090
I don't know. Why don't you ask him?

00:12:24.090 --> 00:12:25.540
He didn't say anything, though.

00:12:25.540 --> 00:12:27.940
Then he probably didn't notice.

00:12:27.940 --> 00:12:31.300
Please, don't say anything 
about this to Ougai-san.

00:12:34.250 --> 00:12:36.340
Fine, if you insist.

00:12:36.740 --> 00:12:38.060
Thank you so much.

00:12:41.300 --> 00:12:42.950
But in return...

00:12:45.510 --> 00:12:47.560
I want you to pose as a model for me.

00:12:47.560 --> 00:12:48.670
Model?

00:12:49.370 --> 00:12:51.320
If you're going to ask me to lie for you,

00:12:51.320 --> 00:12:54.080
then I think you can at least give 
me a show of good faith in return.

00:12:54.080 --> 00:12:56.650
B-But there's no way I could be a model.

00:12:56.650 --> 00:12:59.700
I don't have a good figure, and I have 
some flab on my tummy that would be

00:12:59.700 --> 00:13:02.740
pretty amazing if I took my clothes off,
 and not in a good way.

00:13:02.740 --> 00:13:03.670
Huh?

00:13:04.240 --> 00:13:08.840
Do you think I'm asking you 
to pose nude or something?

00:13:08.840 --> 00:13:10.320
Aren't you?

00:13:10.320 --> 00:13:12.010
I wouldn't mind if you did.

00:13:12.010 --> 00:13:13.290
No, I couldn't do it.

00:13:13.290 --> 00:13:16.660
How are you going 
to return this favor, then?

00:13:16.660 --> 00:13:19.510
Tell me. Come on. Hurry up.

00:13:25.480 --> 00:13:26.980
That's enough, Syunso.

00:13:28.380 --> 00:13:31.360
I will not allow you to 
upset my Little Squirrel.

00:13:31.360 --> 00:13:33.740
I wasn't upsetting her.

00:13:33.740 --> 00:13:36.610
I was simply asking her to pose for me.

00:13:36.880 --> 00:13:38.110
Oh?

00:13:38.960 --> 00:13:41.130
Then let me give you a piece of advice.

00:13:41.430 --> 00:13:45.660
You haven't briefly forgotten to be respectful
of your painting's subject, have you?

00:13:45.660 --> 00:13:49.120
If you're going to ask her to pose for you, 
 you should be careful how you phrase it.

00:13:50.640 --> 00:13:51.760
Fine.

00:13:55.570 --> 00:13:56.940
Good grief.

00:13:56.940 --> 00:13:59.680
He must be in a rebellious 
phase with that bad attitude.

00:13:59.680 --> 00:14:01.320
I am sorry about that, Mei.

00:14:01.320 --> 00:14:02.420
It's fine.

00:14:02.420 --> 00:14:04.420
I better go help now.

00:14:04.420 --> 00:14:05.940
Fumi-san!

00:14:17.140 --> 00:14:25.820
Put all the crows in the world to death.

00:14:25.820 --> 00:14:33.310
I wish to slumber late into 
the morning with my lord.

00:14:33.310 --> 00:14:35.300
What is it?

00:14:35.600 --> 00:14:37.900
Have you finished transferring the beans?

00:14:37.900 --> 00:14:42.070
No, not yet... But, well, I was 
watching you in fascination.

00:14:42.070 --> 00:14:44.100
My, what a tease you are.

00:14:44.100 --> 00:14:47.880
I might have to make you my bride
if you keep saying such cute things.

00:14:49.550 --> 00:14:52.070
I might discover something new about myself.

00:14:54.350 --> 00:14:56.070
Now what?

00:14:57.660 --> 00:14:59.830
Somebody help me!

00:14:59.830 --> 00:15:01.270
Oh, that's...

00:15:03.090 --> 00:15:05.940
I thought that might be you, Kyoka-chan.

00:15:05.940 --> 00:15:08.020
Don't call me Kyoka-chan!

00:15:08.020 --> 00:15:11.130
You'd better hurry up now 
or you're going to get bit.

00:15:11.130 --> 00:15:13.230
Can't you run any faster?

00:15:15.610 --> 00:15:16.770
Stay away!

00:15:16.770 --> 00:15:19.270
Kyoka-san, quickly, come in here!

00:15:21.490 --> 00:15:24.010
Sorry, doggy, you can't come in.

00:15:26.110 --> 00:15:30.850
Well, now look what you've done.

00:15:30.850 --> 00:15:34.830
I-I'm sorry. Kyoka-san just 
seemed so miserable out there.

00:15:34.830 --> 00:15:37.180
A little puppy like that 
isn't such a big deal.

00:15:37.180 --> 00:15:39.750
Men are not allowed in a geisha house.

00:15:39.750 --> 00:15:41.140
What? They aren't?

00:15:41.590 --> 00:15:44.130
Men aren't allowed, my ass.

00:15:44.130 --> 00:15:45.550
No comments from the peanut gallery.

00:15:45.550 --> 00:15:46.330
Ow!

00:15:46.330 --> 00:15:48.190
That really hurts, doesn't it?

00:15:48.190 --> 00:15:50.510
I've lost track of how many 
times I've been hit with it.

00:15:50.510 --> 00:15:51.510
Huh?

00:15:51.510 --> 00:15:55.530
I have been learning proper 
etiquette here since yesterday.

00:15:55.530 --> 00:15:59.380
I want to become a beautiful and 
elegant woman like Otoyakko-san!

00:15:59.380 --> 00:16:01.080
Huh?

00:16:01.640 --> 00:16:04.910
Well, that's the gist of it, 
so please don't bother us.

00:16:04.910 --> 00:16:06.890
I will bring you some water for now.

00:16:07.280 --> 00:16:09.440
Once you've finished it, you need to leave.

00:16:09.930 --> 00:16:11.990
It's a good thing you didn't get bitten.

00:16:11.990 --> 00:16:13.240
Shut up!

00:16:13.240 --> 00:16:15.720
I wasn't running away from the dog,

00:16:15.720 --> 00:16:18.480
I was just making up for my 
lack of exercise as of late.

00:16:18.790 --> 00:16:20.170
Why are you looking at me like that?

00:16:20.170 --> 00:16:21.280
S-Sorry.

00:16:21.280 --> 00:16:26.110
For crying out loud! I've wound up stranded 
here thanks to your meddling.

00:16:26.110 --> 00:16:27.570
What a disaster.

00:16:30.550 --> 00:16:32.100
Don't make your stomach growl at me!

00:16:32.100 --> 00:16:34.930
You're supposed to be learning 
about manners, you dolt!

00:16:34.930 --> 00:16:36.050
I'm sorry!

00:16:36.050 --> 00:16:39.260
Ugh... Here, eating an anpan might help.

00:16:39.260 --> 00:16:40.800
You're giving it to me?

00:16:40.800 --> 00:16:44.540
I'm not trying to thank you or anything, 
so don't get the wrong idea.

00:16:44.540 --> 00:16:48.050
I wouldn't be able to stand it 
if you started drooling in front of me.

00:16:48.360 --> 00:16:49.800
Thank you so much!

00:16:49.800 --> 00:16:51.060
Time to eat...

00:16:52.730 --> 00:16:55.600
Uh, what kind of ceremony is that?

00:16:55.600 --> 00:17:00.080
It's not a ceremony. I'm just 
sterilizing the anpan.

00:17:00.500 --> 00:17:04.590
I can't put anything in my mouth when 
I don't know who might've touched it.

00:17:04.590 --> 00:17:08.200
If I grill it like this, it'll be 
clean and it won't upset my stomach.

00:17:08.870 --> 00:17:11.360
Is this anpan really that dangerous?

00:17:11.360 --> 00:17:15.350
I can never be sure, even if it comes from 
somewhere as famous as the Kimuraya.

00:17:15.350 --> 00:17:17.310
These are famous?

00:17:17.310 --> 00:17:19.400
Wait, you haven't heard of the Kimuraya?

00:17:19.400 --> 00:17:21.730
I kinda have and kinda haven't.

00:17:22.340 --> 00:17:23.850
Are you dumb or something?

00:17:23.850 --> 00:17:26.110
What's with such a vague answer?

00:17:26.110 --> 00:17:27.610
Are you dumb? Hey.

00:17:27.610 --> 00:17:28.850
Are you dumb?

00:17:28.850 --> 00:17:31.360
You called me dumb three times!

00:17:32.670 --> 00:17:33.920
So good...

00:17:33.920 --> 00:17:36.610
Don't just stuff it in your 
mouth. That's vulgar.

00:17:36.610 --> 00:17:41.130
I don't get how Mori-san can 
be so interested in you.

00:17:41.850 --> 00:17:46.590
T-That's true. Why would he be 
interested in someone like me?

00:17:47.300 --> 00:17:49.080
W-What's with you all of the sudden?

00:17:49.080 --> 00:17:51.170
Well, you are right, Kyoka-san.

00:17:51.170 --> 00:17:54.650
I'm not very smart, nor particularly pretty.

00:17:54.650 --> 00:17:59.240
And I'm constantly being taken care of by 
Ougai-san and I can't really do anything in return.

00:17:59.240 --> 00:18:01.220
You should just do something about it, then.

00:18:01.220 --> 00:18:06.050
That's why I'm studying etiquette like this, 
so that I might be able to be somewhat useful.

00:18:06.050 --> 00:18:09.410
Hey! You'll get spit everywhere 
if you talk so loud.

00:18:09.410 --> 00:18:11.780
I stood in line to
buy these anpans...

00:18:14.970 --> 00:18:19.530
All right now, there's no need for a girl 
learning manners to make such a ridiculous voice.

00:18:22.610 --> 00:18:24.170
The cushion is on fire!

00:18:24.170 --> 00:18:25.580
The fire is spreading!

00:18:25.580 --> 00:18:27.680
Don't come this way!

00:18:38.090 --> 00:18:40.040
What the hell were you two thinking?!

00:18:40.040 --> 00:18:43.100
This place could've gone up 
in flames, you nincompoops!

00:18:43.100 --> 00:18:44.720
M-My bad.

00:18:44.720 --> 00:18:45.940
I'm sorry.

00:18:45.940 --> 00:18:49.720
Why are you apologizing? 
I'm the one who was using the fire.

00:18:49.720 --> 00:18:54.120
But I was the one who distracted 
you with such an odd conversation.

00:18:54.120 --> 00:18:57.690
What? I wouldn't get distracted 
by someone like you!

00:18:57.690 --> 00:19:00.310
So, anyway, were you burned?

00:19:00.800 --> 00:19:04.070
Don't worry about me. What about you?

00:19:04.410 --> 00:19:05.860
Is your hand okay?

00:19:05.860 --> 00:19:08.160
Your kimono didn't catch fire
 or anything, did it?

00:19:08.160 --> 00:19:09.860
No, I'm fine.

00:19:09.860 --> 00:19:14.580
Well now, when did you two 
suddenly get so chummy?

00:19:14.580 --> 00:19:16.380
I'm almost jealous.

00:19:16.380 --> 00:19:18.190
Stay back. You'll get germs on me.

00:19:18.190 --> 00:19:19.840
Germs...

00:19:20.110 --> 00:19:22.740
Are you sure you want to speak to me like that?

00:19:22.740 --> 00:19:26.360
Who will be the one compensating me for 
the burned tatami mats and seat cushions?

00:19:27.850 --> 00:19:30.590
On that note, I have something 
to discuss with you.

00:19:30.590 --> 00:19:34.480
There is a large banquet this evening, 
and we don't have enough geisha for it.

00:19:34.480 --> 00:19:35.230
No way.

00:19:35.520 --> 00:19:39.210
You're going to tell me to dress 
like a girl and go to the party.

00:19:39.600 --> 00:19:42.450
Good guess. I'll be counting on you.

00:19:43.120 --> 00:19:44.550
Don't be ridiculous!

00:19:44.550 --> 00:19:46.920
Who the heck would imitate some third-rate—

00:19:46.920 --> 00:19:48.030
I'll do it!

00:19:48.030 --> 00:19:48.880
What?

00:19:49.190 --> 00:19:51.530
Otoyakko-san has been taking 
such good care of me,

00:19:51.530 --> 00:19:54.270
and I am also responsible 
for the fire earlier,

00:19:54.270 --> 00:19:56.130
so please let me help somehow!

00:19:56.130 --> 00:19:58.980
W-What nonsense are you talking now?

00:19:58.980 --> 00:20:01.300
Do you have any idea what 
kind of party this is?

00:20:01.300 --> 00:20:06.430
He's right. I can't have a naïve girl like 
you dealing with a bunch of drunken men.

00:20:06.430 --> 00:20:11.660
But you deal with people like that at work 
every day, don't you, Otoyakko-san?

00:20:11.660 --> 00:20:13.640
Well, it's not exactly every day...

00:20:13.640 --> 00:20:18.150
I will do my very best to 
help you in any way I can!

00:20:18.150 --> 00:20:19.140
Please let me do it!

00:20:19.140 --> 00:20:22.280
You are such a good girl.

00:20:22.280 --> 00:20:25.730
All right, then, since you insist 
with such determination,

00:20:25.730 --> 00:20:27.650
I will gladly accept your help.

00:20:28.070 --> 00:20:31.240
Now, I'm going to give you a cursory lesson 
on manners at a party before tonight,

00:20:31.240 --> 00:20:33.420
so make sure to drum it into your head.

00:20:33.420 --> 00:20:34.350
Yes, ma'am!

00:20:34.350 --> 00:20:36.070
That goes for you too, Kyoka-chan.

00:20:36.070 --> 00:20:36.920
No way!

00:20:36.920 --> 00:20:38.970
Let's do our best, Kyoka-san.

00:20:38.970 --> 00:20:40.080
Don't touch me!

00:20:40.080 --> 00:20:42.040
Oh, I'm sorry.

00:20:42.040 --> 00:20:44.640
Good grief. What a difficult man he is.

00:20:47.360 --> 00:20:49.650
You summoned me, Ougai-san?

00:20:49.650 --> 00:20:52.820
Yes. Do you know where Mei has gone?

00:20:52.820 --> 00:20:53.830
No idea.

00:20:53.830 --> 00:20:55.600
Perhaps you know what 
time she will be back?

00:20:55.600 --> 00:20:56.150
I do not.

00:20:56.150 --> 00:20:58.410
That presents quite a problem.

00:20:58.730 --> 00:21:00.230
What is the matter?

00:21:00.230 --> 00:21:02.410
I received a telegram a little while ago.

00:21:02.410 --> 00:21:05.780
A popular party is suddenly 
being held this evening.

00:21:05.780 --> 00:21:09.530
By "popular party," you mean that bothersome 
drinking party where the higher-ups

00:21:09.530 --> 00:21:13.030
from the government and big shots 
from the industrial groups gather?

00:21:14.220 --> 00:21:19.040
No need to be so harsh. It is a rather 
useful gathering for exchanging information.

00:21:19.040 --> 00:21:23.110
And what does that have to 
do with her not being here?

00:21:23.540 --> 00:21:27.580
I figured I would take this opportunity to 
introduce her as my fiancée to everyone there,

00:21:27.580 --> 00:21:29.660
but if she's not here, I will 
just have to make do.

00:21:29.660 --> 00:21:32.070
So it will just be you and I going tonight.

00:21:32.070 --> 00:21:33.060
I'm going as well?

00:21:33.060 --> 00:21:34.530
Naturally.

00:21:35.570 --> 00:21:38.540
What occasion will we 
be drinking to this time?

00:21:38.540 --> 00:21:42.780
Apparently Iwasaki Tosuke-kun seems to 
want to talk about electric generators.

00:21:42.780 --> 00:21:45.760
Electric generators?
 So electricity, basically.

00:21:45.760 --> 00:21:48.360
Well, he is the foremost 
expert in electricity.

00:21:48.360 --> 00:21:51.940
I wonder if the age of 
electricity is truly upon us.

00:21:52.250 --> 00:21:54.110
Isn't it fascinating?

00:21:54.120 --> 00:21:58.460
I am truly curious to see how 
he will develop the conversation

00:21:58.460 --> 00:22:00.540
in such a crowded room at a party.

00:22:03.350 --> 00:22:04.440
Syunso.

00:22:04.440 --> 00:22:05.280
What is it?

00:22:05.280 --> 00:22:09.670
I have a feeling that something 
delightful will happen this evening.

00:22:12.250 --> 00:22:13.810
You're doing it wrong again!

00:22:15.980 --> 00:22:17.320
Come on now!

00:22:17.320 --> 00:22:19.320
How many times do I have to 
tell you to prop the tip

00:22:19.320 --> 00:22:21.970
of the bottle up with your left 
hand when pouring a drink?!

00:22:22.920 --> 00:22:25.980
Sir, please have one!

00:22:25.980 --> 00:22:27.180
No! Wrong!

00:23:30.010 --> 00:23:40.010
<b>Meiji Tokyo Renka</b>

00:23:30.010 --> 00:23:40.010
Next Episode Preview

00:23:30.010 --> 00:23:40.010
Electricity of Dreams and Passion

00:23:31.030 --> 00:23:34.860
Behold, you are truly
 a vision this evening.

00:23:34.860 --> 00:23:37.640
This is me?

00:23:37.640 --> 00:23:39.760
Ridiculous! I'm done!
